      "text": "  rule #removeDuplicatesBody\n    => If(\n         Compare(\n           Call(\n             Attribute(Name(\"numbers\"), \"count\"),\n             Name(\"number\"), .Exprs),\n           CmpOp(\"==\", Int(1))),\n         Expr(\n           Call(\n             Attribute(Name(\"result\"), \"append\"),\n             Name(\"number\"), .Exprs))\n         .Stmts,\n         .Stmts)\n       .Stmts"
    },
