      "start_line": 53,
      "text": "  rule #removeDuplicatesClosure\n    => closureVal(\n         \"numbers\",\n         Assign(Name(\"result\"), ListExpr(.Exprs))\n         For(\n           Name(\"number\"),\n           Name(\"numbers\"),\n           #removeDuplicatesBody)\n         Return(Name(\"result\"))\n         .Stmts,\n         0)"
